@startuml
title Aquality Store - Secuencia Usuario Registrado

actor "Usuario Registrado" as User
boundary "Frontend" as Frontend
control "AuthController" as Auth
control "ProductController" as Products
control "CartController" as Cart
control "OrderController" as Orders
control "PaymentController" as Payments
control "OrderService" as OrderService
control "EmailService" as Email
database "Database" as DB
actor "Pasarela de Pago" as Gateway

== Autenticación ==

User -> Frontend: Iniciar sesión
Frontend -> Auth: POST /api/auth/login
Auth -> DB: Buscar usuario
DB --> Auth: Usuario
Auth --> Frontend: Token de autenticación
Frontend --> User: Sesión iniciada

== Catálogo ==

User -> Frontend: Abrir catálogo
Frontend -> Products: GET /api/products
Products -> DB: Consultar productos
DB --> Products: Productos
Products --> Frontend: JSON
Frontend --> User: Mostrar catálogo

== Carrito ==

User -> Frontend: Agregar producto
Frontend -> Cart: POST /api/cart/items
Cart -> DB: Guardar CartItem
DB --> Cart: Confirmación
Cart --> Frontend: Carrito actualizado

== Compra ==

User -> Frontend: Confirmar compra
Frontend -> Orders: POST /api/orders

Orders -> OrderService: crearPedido()
OrderService -> DB: Crear Order
OrderService -> DB: Crear OrderItems
DB --> OrderService: Pedido creado

OrderService --> Orders: Pedido pendiente
Orders --> Frontend: Datos del pedido

== Pago ==

User -> Frontend: Seleccionar método de pago

alt Pago online

    Frontend -> Payments: POST /api/payments
    Payments -> Gateway: Crear transacción
    Gateway --> Payments: Resultado del pago
    Payments --> Frontend: Estado del pago

else Transferencia bancaria

    Frontend -> Payments: Registrar método
    Payments -> DB: Guardar Payment
    DB --> Payments: Confirmación

else Contraentrega

    Frontend -> Payments: Registrar método
    Payments -> DB: Guardar Payment
    DB --> Payments: Confirmación

end

== Confirmación ==

OrderService -> DB: Actualizar estado pedido
OrderService -> Email: enviarConfirmacion()
Email --> User: Correo de confirmación

Frontend --> User: Compra realizada

@enduml